      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would also love to see something change along these lines. I do guitar and piano performances in VR and the current possibilities for tracking my hands while performing in VR are very limited and each have their own drawbacks. Being able to strap FBT trackers to the backs of my wrists and disable my controllers would be perfect.",
