  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This might be a missing feature or a bug regarding steamvr and the input 2.0 update.\n\nUsing custom hand tracker controllers (such as DriverLeap by SD_Draw) enables vrchat hand controls but doesn't seem to allow attaching trackers to the wrists to keep tracking when the hands are out of range for the hand controller. Example is showing here:\n\nhttps://x.com/sadlyitsbradley/status/1818409885131837742?s=46&t=PWLKOtocw_E1Y1T_t6pAPQ",
